msgstr "発見から利用可能な機能を選択してください。"

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:38
msgid "Read a post checklist"
msgstr "投稿のチェックリストを読み取る"

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:39
msgid ""
"Read the native checklist for an editable saved post, respecting ignored "
"roles and active Pro status/taxonomy exclusions. Results are native server "
